m940002.……戦が起きれば、民は困窮しますからな。\n怒りだけで戦うことはできない、\nそ:
……If war breaks out, the people will suffer.
One cannot wage war on anger alone;
that is an undeniable truth.

m940002.今のうちに陣形を立て直せ！\n敵はこちらの戦術の基礎を作った者たちだ、\n隙を見:
Reorganize the formation now!
The enemy are the ones who laid the foundation for our tactics;
if you show an opening, they will tear you apart!

m940002.白の帝国が謳う実力主義に、権威など存在しない。\n皇帝の正当性とは、ひとえに先王:
In the meritocracy the White Empire preaches, authority means nothing.
The Emperor's legitimacy rests solely on the abdication by the late King;
that fact is his greatest backing.
